<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/checksum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/checksum#CRC32> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An integrity-check identifier for a 32-bit cyclic redundancy check. A profile/processor contract must resolve the CRC variant rather than infer it from width alone."@en .
